{"speciesId":293,"names":{"fr":"Chuchmur","es":"Whismur","en":"Whismur","ja":"ゴニョニョ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"Normally, WHISMUR’s voice is very quiet - it is barely audible even if one is paying close attention. However, if this POKéMON senses danger, it starts crying at an earsplitting volume."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"WHISMUR is very timid. If it starts to cry loudly, it becomes startled by its own crying and cries even harder. When it finally stops crying, the POKéMON goes to sleep, all tired out."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its cries equal a jet plane in volume. It inhales through its ear canals. Because of this system, it can cry continually without having to catch its breath."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It usually murmurs, but starts crying loudly if it senses danger. It stops when its ear covers are shut."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It usually murmurs, but starts crying loudly if it senses danger. It stops when its ear covers are shut."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"En temps normal, son cri est pareil à un murmure. Effrayé, il atteint le volume d’un avion à réaction."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"En temps normal, son cri est pareil à un murmure. Effrayé, il atteint le volume d’un avion à réaction."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Usually, its cries are like quiet murmurs. If frightened, it shrieks at the same volume as a jet plane."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il communique en murmurant, mais se met à hurler s’il sent le moindre danger. Il s’arrête quand on lui bouche les oreilles."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Normalmente murmulla, pero cuando siente que hay peligro se pone a chillar. Solo para cuando se le cierran las orejas."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It usually murmurs but starts crying loudly if it senses danger. It stops when its ear covers are shut."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"普段は ささやき 声。危険を 察知すると 大声で 泣き出す。 耳の 蓋を 閉じると 泣きやむ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il repousse ses ennemis grâce à un cri aussi puissant que le bruit d’un avion à réaction."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cuando percibe peligro, lanza gritos con volumen similar al de un reactor e intimida a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"If it senses danger, it scares the foe by crying out with the volume of a jet-plane engine."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"危険を 察知すると ジェット機と 同じ 音量の 鳴き声を 上げて 敵を ひるませるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Généralement, la voix de Chuchmur est très douce, à peine audible, même si on tend l’oreille. Pourtant, lorsque ce Pokémon sent l’approche du danger, il se met à crier si fort qu’il peut déchirer des tympans."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Normalmente, Whismur tiene una voz tenue, casi inaudible, aunque se preste atención. No obstante, si este Pokémon siente que el peligro acecha, puede ponerse a chillar con un volumen ensordecedor."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Normally, Whismur’s voice is very quiet—it is barely audible even if one is paying close attention. However, if this Pokémon senses danger, it starts crying at an earsplitting volume."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"普段は 注意しないと 聞き取れない くらい 小さな 声だが 危険を 察知 すると 頭痛を 起こす ほどの 大声で 鳴き出す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Chuchmur est très timide. S’il commence à pleurer, il s’effraie tout seul et pleure de plus belle. Quand ce Pokémon finit enfin de pleurer, il s’endort, épuisé."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Whismur es muy tímido. Si empieza a gritar fuerte, se asusta a sí mismo y chilla más alto todavía. Cuando para por fin, se va a dormir completamente agotado."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Whismur is very timid. If it starts to cry loudly, it becomes startled by its own crying and cries even harder. When it finally stops crying, the Pokémon goes to sleep, all tired out."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"一度 大声で 鳴き出すと 自分の 声に びっくりして さらに 激しく 鳴く。 鳴き止むと 疲れて 眠ってしまう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Le cri qu’il émet dépasse les 100 décibels et donne une migraine qui dure toute la journée à quiconque se trouve à proximité."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su grito llega a superar los 100 decibelios y provoca a quien lo oiga un dolor de cabeza que puede durar un día entero."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"The cry of a Whismur is over 100 decibels. If you’re close to a Whismur when it lets out a cry, you’ll be stuck with an all-day headache."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"鳴き声は １００デシベルを 超える 音量。 近くで 鳴かれると 一日 頭痛が 治まらない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Quand il se met à crier, il se surprend lui-même et hurle de plus belle. Il continue ainsi jusqu’à ce qu’il se fatigue et tombe de sommeil."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Al chillar, se asusta con su propia voz, lo cual le lleva a gritar más fuerte todavía. Cuando se cansa, se echa a dormir."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"When Whismur cries, the sound of its own voice startles it, making the Pokémon cry even louder. It cries until it’s exhausted, then it falls asleep."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"鳴きはじめると 自分の 声に 驚いて さらに 激しく 鳴く。 鳴き疲れると 眠ってしまう。"}],"varieties":[{"id":293,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"fire-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"thunder-punch","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"whirlwind","learns":[[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0],[23,"egg",0]]},{"name":"stomp","learns":[[5,"level-up",25],[6,"level-up",25],[7,"level-up",25],[8,"level-up",25],[9,"level-up",25],[10,"level-up",25],[11,"level-up",25],[12,"level-up",25],[13,"level-up",25],[14,"level-up",25],[15,"level-up",25],[16,"level-up",22],[17,"level-up",22],[18,"level-up",22],[20,"level-up",21],[23,"level-up",21]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[10,"tutor",0]]},{"nam